<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
    <!--
    ASADO prediction-market daily job. Every day 06:30, runs
    scripts/predmkt_daily_job.py under the ASADO venv. NightWatch allows a 90min
    grace window. Success line in the log is "[predmkt_daily_job] Done."; hard
    failures are "Traceback" or "Conflicting lock".

    Logs to ASADO/Data/logs/predmkt_launchd.log — this exact path is the evidence
    file NightWatch's manifest (asado-predmkt-daily) greps, so do not change it
    without updating overseer/manifest.json.

    RECONSTRUCTED 2026-07-14: the installed file had decayed to a bare JSON
    ProgramArguments array (no Label/StartCalendarInterval/etc) — the same
    corruption that hit six plists at 2026-07-08 22:37:10 and that was fixed for
    com.arjundivecha.asado-daily on 2026-07-09 but not for the others. After the
    2026-07-12 reboot launchd could no longer bootstrap it and the job silently
    stopped running (last run 2026-07-12 06:37). ProgramArguments recovered
    verbatim from the corrupted file; schedule and log paths recovered from
    NightWatch overseer/manifest.json. Corrupted original backed up to
    ~/Library/LaunchAgents/corrupted_backup_2026-07-14/.
    -->
    <key>Label</key>
    <string>com.arjundivecha.asado-predmkt-daily</string>

    <key>EnvironmentVariables</key>
    <dict>
        <key>PATH</key>
        <string>/opt/homebrew/bin:/opt/homebrew/sbin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/bin:/bin:/usr/sbin:/sbin</string>
    </dict>

    <key>ProgramArguments</key>
    <array>
        <string>/Users/arjundivecha/Dropbox/AAA Backup/A Working/ASADO/venv/bin/python</string>
        <string>/Users/arjundivecha/Dropbox/AAA Backup/A Working/ASADO/scripts/predmkt_daily_job.py</string>
    </array>

    <key>WorkingDirectory</key>
    <string>/Users/arjundivecha/Dropbox/AAA Backup/A Working/ASADO</string>

    <key>StartCalendarInterval</key>
    <dict>
        <key>Hour</key>
        <integer>6</integer>
        <key>Minute</key>
        <integer>30</integer>
    </dict>

    <key>StandardOutPath</key>
    <string>/Users/arjundivecha/Dropbox/AAA Backup/A Working/ASADO/Data/logs/predmkt_launchd.log</string>
    <key>StandardErrorPath</key>
    <string>/Users/arjundivecha/Dropbox/AAA Backup/A Working/ASADO/Data/logs/predmkt_launchd.log</string>

    <key>RunAtLoad</key>
    <false/>
</dict>
</plist>
